================================================================================
Third-party components
================================================================================

repo-mcp embeds and redistributes the following components. They are used
unmodified; repo-mcp is an independent project and is not affiliated with or
endorsed by their authors.

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
codebase-memory-mcp — the indexing engine
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

  Upstream:  https://github.com/DeusData/codebase-memory-mcp
  Licence:   MIT
  Used as:   a pre-built binary, downloaded at image build time and invoked
             over stdio and its command line. No source is vendored into this
             repository and no changes are made to it.

  What repo-mcp uses it for: parsing repositories into a knowledge graph and
  answering structural queries against that graph. Everything else — network
  transport, identity, tenancy, authorization, auditing, repository discovery
  and the reasoning layer — is repo-mcp's own code.

  See docs/engine.md for the engine behaviours that constrain repo-mcp's
  design, and docs/adr/0001-wrap-dont-fork.md for why it is wrapped rather
  than forked.

