--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
graph-ui — the web interface
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

  Upstream:  https://github.com/DeusData/codebase-memory-mcp, graph-ui/
  Adopted:   commit d6be58ef9d43c574a2d1b0827ecc1e3c4846f0fe
  Licence:   MIT
  Used as:   source, under gateway/webui/, modified.

  The interface repo-mcp serves at /ui is the engine project's own, adopted
  rather than rewritten. What was changed and why is recorded in
  gateway/webui/README.md, and the reasoning is in
  docs/adr/0011-adopt-the-upstream-interface.md. In short: its JSON-RPC client
  was pointed at repo-mcp's authorized /mcp endpoint instead of the engine's
  loopback server, sign-in and squad selection were added, and the surfaces
  that only make sense on a single machine were removed.

  Its own dependencies — React, Three.js, Tailwind and the rest — are declared
  in gateway/webui/package.json and pinned in package-lock.json. They are
  installed at image build time rather than vendored here, and their licences
  travel with them.

